msgid "Play all songs in a localtracks folder.\n\n"
"        **Usage**:\n"
"        ​ ​ ​ ​ `[p]local folder`\n"
"        ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ Open a menu to pick a folder to queue.\n\n"
"        ​ ​ `[p]local folder folder_name`\n"
"        ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ Queues all of the tracks inside the folder_name folder.\n"
"        "
